<rml>
<head>
    <title>OpenTricky dialog</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="launcher.rcss"/>
</head>
<!-- The dialogs shown over the page: one section per dialog, the launcher
     sets "modal" to the one to show. -->
<body data-model="ot" class="dialog">
    <div class="dim"></div>
    <div class="stage" id="stage">

        <div class="box sec" data-if="modal == 'capture'">
            <div class="kick">{{cap_kind}}</div>
            <div class="dh">PRESS A KEY</div>
            <p class="c">New for <b>{{cap_for}}</b> &#xB7; now <b>{{cap_now}}</b></p>
            <div class="wait">&#x2026;</div>
            <p class="c dim2">{{cap_hint}}</p>
            <div class="btns c">
                <span class="mbtn" id="cap-cancel" data-event-click="dlg('cap_cancel')">Esc &#xB7; Cancel</span>
                <span class="mbtn" id="cap-clear" data-event-click="dlg('cap_clear')">Backspace &#xB7; Clear</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box sec" data-if="modal == 'conflict'">
            <div class="kick">{{conf_kind}}</div>
            <div class="dh">KEY ALREADY USED</div>
            <p>{{conf_line}}</p>
            <div class="note">{{conf_swap}}</div>
            <div class="btns">
                <span class="mbtn pri" id="swap" data-event-click="dlg('swap')">Swap</span>
                <span class="mbtn" id="both" data-event-click="dlg('both')">{{conf_both}}</span>
                <span class="mbtn ghost" id="conf-cancel" data-event-click="dlg('conf_cancel')">Cancel</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box wide sec" data-if="modal == 'crash'">
            <div class="kick">LAST SESSION</div>
            <div class="dh">{{crash_head}}</div>
            <p>Sorry about that. A bug report helps fix it: it is a zip with the logs, your settings and a crash file.
               It never contains your disc image or your saves.</p>
            <div class="mono"><div>{{crash_when}}</div><div>{{crash_version}}</div></div>
            <div class="btns">
                <span class="mbtn pri" id="crash-report" data-event-click="dlg('report')">Prepare a bug report</span>
                <span class="mbtn" id="crash-logs" data-event-click="dlg('logs')">Open logs</span>
                <span class="mbtn ghost" id="crash-close" data-event-click="dlg('close')">Not now</span>
            </div>
            <p class="small">The zip is saved on your Desktop. Nothing is sent automatically: attach it to a GitHub issue if you want.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="box sec" data-if="modal == 'report_ask'">
            <div class="kick">TROUBLESHOOTING</div>
            <div class="dh">PREPARE A BUG REPORT?</div>
            <p>A zip on your Desktop with the launcher's and the game's logs, your settings (folders left out) and the last crash report.
               Never your disc image or your saves. Nothing is sent.</p>
            <div class="btns">
                <span class="mbtn pri" id="ask-report" data-event-click="dlg('report')">Prepare</span>
                <span class="mbtn ghost" id="ask-cancel" data-event-click="dlg('close')">Cancel</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box sec" data-if="modal == 'notice'">
            <div class="dh">{{notice_head}}</div>
            <p>{{notice_text}}</p>
            <div class="btns">
                <span class="mbtn pri" id="notice-ok" data-event-click="dlg('close')">OK</span>
                <span class="mbtn" id="notice-show" data-if="notice_file" data-event-click="dlg('show_file')">Show the file</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Update / restore (ot_install.h): steps, bar, and what to do when it stops. -->
        <div class="box wide sec upd" data-if="modal == 'update'">
            <div class="kick">{{inst_kick}}</div>
            <div class="dh">{{inst_head}}</div>
            <p>{{inst_text}}</p>
            <div data-if="inst_phase == 'run' || inst_phase == 'done' || inst_phase == 'done_manual'">
                <div class="step" data-if="inst_kick != 'RESTORE'" data-class-ok="inst_s1 == 'ok'" data-class-run="inst_s1 == 'run'"><span class="ic">1</span>{{inst_l1}}</div>
                <div class="step" data-if="inst_kick != 'RESTORE'" data-class-ok="inst_s2 == 'ok'" data-class-run="inst_s2 == 'run'"><span class="ic">2</span>Checked &#xB7; SHA-256 matches the release</div>
                <div class="step" data-class-ok="inst_s3 == 'ok'" data-class-run="inst_s3 == 'run'"><span class="ic">3</span>{{inst_l3}}</div>
                <div class="bar"><div class="fill" data-style-width="inst_bar"></div></div>
                <p class="small" data-if="inst_kick != 'RESTORE'">v{{version}} is kept: <b>Settings &#x203A; Advanced &#x203A; Restore</b>.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="btns" data-if="inst_phase == 'fail'">
                <span class="mbtn pri" id="inst-retry" data-event-click="dlg('inst_retry')">Retry</span>
                <span class="mbtn ghost" id="inst-later" data-event-click="dlg('close')">Later</span>
            </div>
            <div class="btns" data-if="inst_phase == 'nowrite'">
                <span class="mbtn pri" id="inst-page" data-event-click="dlg('inst_page')">Open the page</span>
                <span class="mbtn ghost" id="inst-later2" data-event-click="dlg('close')">Later</span>
            </div>
            <div class="btns" data-if="inst_phase == 'done_manual'">
                <span class="mbtn pri" id="inst-ok" data-event-click="dlg('close')">OK</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box wide sec" data-if="modal == 'about'">
            <div class="kick">ABOUT</div>
            <div class="dh">OPENTRICKY v{{version}}</div>
            <div class="kv"><span class="k">PROJECT</span><span class="v">OpenTricky by GiZ</span></div>
            <div class="kv"><span class="k">HD TEXTURES</span><span class="v">Bl4ckH4nd (not included)</span></div>
            <div class="btns">
                <span class="mbtn" id="licences" data-event-click="dlg('licences')">Licences</span>
                <span class="mbtn" id="about-github" data-event-click="dlg('github')">GitHub</span>
                <span class="mbtn ghost" id="about-close" data-event-click="dlg('close')">Close</span>
            </div>
            <p class="small">SSX Tricky is a trademark of Electronic Arts. OpenTricky is a fan project, not affiliated with or endorsed by EA.
               It needs your own copy of the game.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>
</rml>
